dstack
======

dstack is a modified fork of huashu-design by alchaincyf (Huashu).

  Upstream:  https://github.com/alchaincyf/huashu-design
  Licence:   MIT (see LICENSE; the original copyright notice is kept unchanged)

Based on the English translation made locally from upstream v3.0.0
(snapshot of huashu-design-en taken 2026-10-27 23:46:35 IST).

Changes in dstack (summary; see git log for detail):
  - Renamed the pack/skill to "dstack"; user data now lives in ~/.dstack
    (DSTACK_HOME; HUASHU_DESIGN_HOME still honoured as a fallback).
  - Removed bundled audio whose licence could not be verified:
    assets/bgm-*.mp3 (generated with Suno) and assets/sfx/** (generated with
    ElevenLabs). Music and sound effects are now user-supplied files, plus an
    optional offline music library outside the repo (DSTACK_AUDIO_PROVIDER=local,
    ~/.dstack/music + manifest.json with licence and attribution); no audio
    files are committed (.gitignore guard).
  - Removed every China-hosted cloud integration (ByteDance/Volcengine Doubao
    TTS, Volcengine Ark video review: removed). AI review is an optional,
    off-by-default hook with no provider wired in. TTS, sound effects and
    music have one optional, off-by-default provider: ElevenLabs (US host
    api.elevenlabs.io, REST API, needs ELEVENLABS_API_KEY).
  - Removed the automatic remote version check.
  - Playwright bumped to 1.64.1; absolute-path INSTALL_BODY.md added.
  - English tuning: language-aware body-text detection in design_lint.py and
    English sentence/word-aware subtitle splitting in narration_stage.jsx,
    with tests; the md-html narration demo now carries English subtitles.
  - Workflow additions: cover/single-image route with exact-size presets
    (scripts/cover.py, references/modules/cover.md), non-blocking gate
    default for unattended runs (scripts/gate.py), cookie/consent dismissal and
    clear bot-check failure in ref_board.py, capability detection that sees
    runtime image tools, a fixed learn.py harvest, roulette redraw rule,
    optional headlines on text-free thumbnails/covers.
  - Removed all promotion of the original author's other products, courses
    and social accounts (README, references/about-author.md deleted, demo
    wordmarks/watermarks such as "HUASHU · DESIGN" replaced with dstack or
    neutral text, the default promo watermark dropped). Credit stays here
    and in LICENSE. HOSTS.md lists every outside host (tools/host_inventory.py).
  - One English README (README.zh.md / README.en.md removed). Chinese-only
    demos, samples and copy were deleted or translated to English; Chinese
    file names renamed. CJK is kept only where it is functional (CJK font
    names, CJK punctuation/length handling and their tests, and the East
    Asian typography style specimens).

